{"type":"html","bg":"white","html":"<div class=\"lab\" style=\"margin-bottom:24px\">Privacy by design</div><div class=\"h1\" style=\"font-size:104px;margin-bottom:32px\">\"Delete my account\" is <span style=\"background:var(--y);padding:0 12px\">four decisions.</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;margin-bottom:20px\"><div class=\"item\" style=\"padding:26px 36px\"><div class=\"n\" style=\"font-size:60px\">01</div><div class=\"p\" style=\"font-size:40px\">Erase what only serves the user.</div></div><div class=\"item\" style=\"padding:26px 36px\"><div class=\"n\" style=\"font-size:60px\">02</div><div class=\"p\" style=\"font-size:40px\">Anonymise what feeds your metrics.</div></div><div class=\"item\" style=\"padding:26px 36px\"><div class=\"n\" style=\"font-size:60px\">03</div><div class=\"p\" style=\"font-size:40px\">Lock what the law makes you keep.</div></div><div class=\"item\" style=\"padding:26px 36px\"><div class=\"n\" style=\"font-size:60px\">04</div><div class=\"p\" style=\"font-size:40px\">Stop backups from bringing it back.</div></div></div><div class=\"box\" style=\"background:var(--k);color:var(--w);padding:36px 56px;margin-bottom:28px\"><div class=\"h2\" style=\"font-size:50px\">Design it before the first sign-up.</div></div>","sign":"I design products that cannot afford to fail.","cue":""}
